summary:
  The capture is ended also under a listener who plays inside the buffer.

history:
  A listener inside the buffer moves with the window and is never pushed
  out of it. Only a place that stands still is: a park.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          if (slide && writerUp && !shifted && _stage === "" && SlideLogic.parkEndsCapture(shiftPosMs, runMs, keepMs)) _endCapture();

replace:
          if (slide && writerUp && _stage === "" && SlideLogic.parkEndsCapture(shiftPosMs, runMs, keepMs)) _endCapture();

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_only_a_park_in_a_running_sliding_buffer_ends_a_capture.
